From: Codex M2 native32 runtime compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] Include GLES1 wrapper required by Exynos9810 gralloc

Reason: actual camera open aborts provider: dlopen gralloc.exynos9810.so fails
because system32 libGLESv1_CM.so is missing. Extend the existing hash-pinned
S22 native32 compatibility set by that wrapper only; no hardware/blob swap,
app ABI, ART or radio change. File: a376b_native32.lock.json.
Verify source hash/ELF dependencies, actual Camera open/provider and OMX logs,
normal native32 final metadata verifier and complete source patch replay.
Rollback: remove the previously absent system/lib/libGLESv1_CM.so on the test
phone or reverse this lock entry and rebuild via the existing fork.

